---
title: Release week
config:
  theme: redux
  gantt:
    axisFormat: '%d %b'
    tickInterval: 12hour
  themeVariables:
    sectionBkgColor: "#4c6ef5"
    altSectionBkgColor: "#12b886"
    doneTaskBkgColor: "#adb5bd"
    activeTaskBkgColor: "#f59f00"
    gridColor: "#ced4da"
---
gantt
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    section Cut
    Freeze the branch :done, f, 2026-03-02, 1d
    Tag the release   :active, t, after f, 1d
    section Ship
    Publish           :p, after t, 2d
